---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { IMAGES } from '../../data/site';

const programs = [
  {
    title: 'Nutritious Meal',
    href: '/elders/nutritious-meal',
    text: 'So that they do not sleep empty stomach.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Grocery Support',
    href: '/elders/groceries-support',
    text: 'So that they can keep themselves clean and away from diseases.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Blankets',
    href: '/elders/distribution-of-blankets',
    text: 'To cover themselves in cold weather.',
  },
];
---

<Layout
  title="Elders — GWE NGO INDIA"
  description="GWE NGO India supports senior citizens with nutritious meals, grocery support and blankets, so elders live the rest of their lives happily and healthily."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main">
    <section class="page-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>Elders</h1>
        <p>They do not want your money — they want your support, time and love.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container prose">
        <img src={IMAGES.elders} alt="Old age home — donate for elders in Kurnool" loading="lazy" />
        <p>
          It is very true to say that old age people need the same amount of love, care, time and
          support as children do. Both are in an age where they require someone to be on their side
          but usually, children do get that love and support whereas old aged people do not. One
          should understand that they do not want your money, but your support, time and love.
        </p>
        <p>
          GWE NGO India is trying to make some efforts in order to help them live the rest of their
          lives happily and in a healthy manner. We think that at this age, the most important
          things that they need are —
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Nutritious meal so that they do not sleep empty stomach</li>
          <li>Grocery support so that they can keep themselves clean and away from diseases</li>
          <li>Blankets to cover themselves in cold weather</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Keeping the above things in mind we have come up with individual programs so that we can
          do as much as possible for our elders.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section--alt">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Our Programs for Elders</h2>
        <div class="grid program-grid">
          {
            programs.map((p) => (
              <a href={p.href} class="card program-card">
                <div class="card__body">
                  <h3>{p.title}</h3>
                  <p>{p.text}</p>
                  <span class="program-card__link">Learn more →</span>
                </div>
              </a>
            ))
          }
        </div>
        <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/donate">Donate for Elders</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .program-grid {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .program-card {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .program-card__link {
    color: var(--color-primary-600);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
